  "question": {
    "text": "\"Extraction of gold $(\\mathrm{Au})$ involves the formation of complex ions $X$ and $Y$\r\n<img src=\"https://panel-qbank.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/previous-yr/images/wbjee/2015_che_q42.png\">\r\n$X$ and $Y$ respectively are",
