  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Extraction of gold (Au) involves the following sequence of reaction,\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\text { Gold ore } \\frac{\\text { Roasting }}{\\mathrm{CN}^{-}, \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}, \\mathrm{O}_{2}} \\quad \\mathrm{HO}^{-}+\\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{CN})_{2}^{-} \r\n\\quad \\stackrel{\\mathrm{Zn}}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathrm{Zn}(\\mathrm{CN})_{4}^{2-}+\\mathrm{Au} \\\\\r\nY\r\n\\end{array}$\r\nHence, $X=\\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{CN})_{2}^{-}, Y=\\mathrm{Zn}(\\mathrm{CN})_{4}^{2-}$",
    "image": null
